<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Eating Your word when I wake,</l><l>Nothing should get in the way;</l><l>Calling ceaselessly on Your name.</l><l>Meeting You with all the saints,</l><l>Feasting on Your boundless grace,</l><l>Praising as I call it a day.</l><l>I’ve let go of all religious regulations;</l><l>Found a new, enjoying way to take.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
